       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. I need you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**Sertraline 1000 mg once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended dose.** The usual adult range is 50\u2013200 mg/day, and 200 mg/day is the labeled maximum. A 1000 mg daily dose has no standard indication and carries a real risk of serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation and seizures. It looks like a possible typo, maybe for **100 mg**.\n\nPlease tell me which of these you want:\n1. **Sertraline 100 mg by mouth once daily** (or another dose within 50\u2013200 mg)\n2. **Sertraline 1000 mg by mouth once daily, as written.** If this is intentional, please confirm it and give a short reason, and I'll add it to the order note.\n\nI'll enter the order as soon as you reply."
